    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6b952587b4102b6105da30c4e2b9e37f.poster.avif?t=1728465937\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6b952587b4102b6105da30c4e2b9e37f.webm?t=1728465937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6b952587b4102b6105da30c4e2b9e37f.mp4?t=1728465937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> &quot;5/5 Hell Yeah murder&quot;</strong>- itch comment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SportKill is a fast pace sports theme 2D brawler, punch to charge up high speed, deadly ball to K.O. your enemy!Battle your friend or team up to fight against CPU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game support up to 4 player, with controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/d7a287f5e40637300a23801f7ed6a77f.avif?t=1728465937\" width=600 height=250 /></span>Now have 3:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stander: Fight and be the last man standing!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point Collect: Hit the ball an collect crystal and steal crystal from other player!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Flag: Capture Team Flag and protect it for all cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6dc9b1ab6440d72f66b550ca52d55b31.avif?t=1728465937\" width=600 height=250 /></span>Little challenge to make the killing more deadly and powerful!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6b952587b4102b6105da30c4e2b9e37f.poster.avif?t=1728465937\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6b952587b4102b6105da30c4e2b9e37f.webm?t=1728465937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6b952587b4102b6105da30c4e2b9e37f.mp4?t=1728465937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> &quot;5/5 Hell Yeah murder&quot;</strong>- itch comment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SportKill is a fast pace sports theme 2D brawler, punch to charge up high speed, deadly ball to K.O. your enemy!Battle your friend or team up to fight against CPU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game support up to 4 player, with controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/d7a287f5e40637300a23801f7ed6a77f.avif?t=1728465937\" width=600 height=250 /></span>Now have 3:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stander: Fight and be the last man standing!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point Collect: Hit the ball an collect crystal and steal crystal from other player!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Flag: Capture Team Flag and protect it for all cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953300/extras/6dc9b1ab6440d72f66b550ca52d55b31.avif?t=1728465937\" width=600 height=250 /></span>Little challenge to make the killing more deadly and powerful!</p>",
